{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grab. Aim. Fling.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>A Ragdoll Rage Game</i></strong> is a brutally unforgiving physics-based climbing game that punishes you for every mistake you make. You control a floppy ragdoll by grabbing onto objects one limb at a time, aiming carefully, and flinging yourself upward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not knowing what the world has to offer, your goal is to explore and make your way to the top.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962540/extras/e964588d1bdbb16d950f7a262fbf007d.poster.avif?t=1774742143\" width=1170 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962540/extras/e964588d1bdbb16d950f7a262fbf007d.webm?t=1774742143\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962540/extras/e964588d1bdbb16d950f7a262fbf007d.mp4?t=1774742143\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EVERY MOVE MATTERS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What begins as a simple climb quickly becomes a test of focus and patience as gravity and <strong>challenging obstacles</strong> stand in your way. The controls may look simple, but mastering them is another story. One wrong move can send you tumbling all the way back down... and you\u2019ll have to decide if you\u2019ve got the determination to climb back up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962540/extras/6e996724cee11c3e9ffb0c8584d60d2c.poster.avif?t=1774742143\" width=1170 height=396 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962540/extras/6e996724cee11c3e9ffb0c8584d60d2c.webm?t=1774742143\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962540/extras/6e996724cee11c3e9ffb0c8584d60d2c.mp4?t=1774742143\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CREATE, SHARE, COMPETE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>Level Editor</strong> lets you build insane climbs and share them with the world. Make a troll map designed to frustrate, a precision climb for speedrunners, or even a challenge where a ball must reach a goal. You are free to get <strong>creative</strong> and watch your friends struggle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Global leaderboards</strong> track players\u2019 fastest times, adding a competitive edge for anyone chasing mastery or bragging rights.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LOOK YOUR BEST, CLIMB YOUR BEST</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your ragdoll deserves to look absolutely ridiculous while flinging through the air. Customize your character with a huge variety of <strong>cosmetics</strong>: hats, shirts, accessories, and more. You can even change the color of your clothes and skin, or upload an image of your face onto the ragdoll. Want to see your ragdoll wearing a maid outfit while spinning wildly? Go for it!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE HIDDEN PATHS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not all climbs are straight up. <strong>Secret paths</strong>,<strong> shortcuts</strong>,<strong> </strong>and <strong>hidden areas</strong> are scattered throughout the levels. Discover these routes to unlock exclusive badges and cosmetics.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics-based climbing</strong> - Player is completely ragdoll, but precisely controllable</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Optional Checkpoints</strong> - Enable checkpoints for a more forgiving climbing experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Secret Paths</strong> - Discover hidden areas and unlock exclusive <strong>badges</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character Customization</strong> - Put your face on your ragdoll and change their look</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cosmetics</strong> - Unlock over <strong>100+ cosmetics</strong> for your ragdoll<strong> </strong>just by playing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Level Editor</strong> - Create your very own levels and share them with your friends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leaderboard</strong> - Compete for the fastest times and climb the rankings</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Searching for gold and I found a diamond.&quot; </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>- A Playtester</i></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Completion Badge","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3962540/92b2a336d844d0ec8aa45fc8637ffc7fd13ce8da.jpg"},{"name":"All Hats Badge","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3962540/1a21a36d9c440139e9585b8f359b992facf51fe2.jpg"},{"name":"Garbage Lid Badge","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3962540/9df227c1d919568cde834a3248876ea2f69040d3.jpg"},{"name":"Spaghetti Badge","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3962540/d4b5a8b4fc7948c97fc948d1caf5d5275b4c3ac0.jpg"},{"name":"Parrot Badge","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3962540/bf05f3af6f0d8811ac689b97554c3b5a833d5b6b.jpg"},{"name":"Useless Coin Badge","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3962540/ec4f1597bdf6c344d0995c7b95db35a7ae969c40.jpg"},{"name":"Not So Hungry Hippo Badge","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3962540/7869423c0cd0a884bd5d04fb5e3cd94c69ab6460.jpg"},{"name":"Lucky Rock Badge","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3962540/e84079bc54510eb4879242d44d9294839993aabd.jpg"},{"name":"Backroom Badge","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3962540/afbccfcaa1b753c8e4b44d42aa6f7f9aaa595e39.jpg"},{"name":"Ignored The Warning Labels Badge","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3962540/70a07d248dbb3544bb992be7d941aff97e0d9929.jpg"}],"total":25},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3962540?t=1774742143","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962540/c18c1ee2a32eb1b5fa8d3203b2d33000b9625db4/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774742143","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962540/3e9914423648d465acddb7d4102d172b3a27c9a6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774742143","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962540/3e9914423648d465acddb7d4102d172b3a27c9a6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774742143","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grab. Aim. Fling.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>A Ragdoll Rage Game</i></strong> is a brutally unforgiving physics-based climbing game that punishes you for every mistake you make. You control a floppy ragdoll by grabbing onto objects one limb at a time, aiming carefully, and flinging yourself upward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not knowing what the world has to offer, your goal is to explore and make your way to the top.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962540/extras/e964588d1bdbb16d950f7a262fbf007d.poster.avif?t=1774742143\" width=1170 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962540/extras/e964588d1bdbb16d950f7a262fbf007d.webm?t=1774742143\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962540/extras/e964588d1bdbb16d950f7a262fbf007d.mp4?t=1774742143\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EVERY MOVE MATTERS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What begins as a simple climb quickly becomes a test of focus and patience as gravity and <strong>challenging obstacles</strong> stand in your way. The controls may look simple, but mastering them is another story. One wrong move can send you tumbling all the way back down... and you\u2019ll have to decide if you\u2019ve got the determination to climb back up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962540/extras/6e996724cee11c3e9ffb0c8584d60d2c.poster.avif?t=1774742143\" width=1170 height=396 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962540/extras/6e996724cee11c3e9ffb0c8584d60d2c.webm?t=1774742143\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962540/extras/6e996724cee11c3e9ffb0c8584d60d2c.mp4?t=1774742143\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CREATE, SHARE, COMPETE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>Level Editor</strong> lets you build insane climbs and share them with the world. Make a troll map designed to frustrate, a precision climb for speedrunners, or even a challenge where a ball must reach a goal. You are free to get <strong>creative</strong> and watch your friends struggle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Global leaderboards</strong> track players\u2019 fastest times, adding a competitive edge for anyone chasing mastery or bragging rights.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LOOK YOUR BEST, CLIMB YOUR BEST</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your ragdoll deserves to look absolutely ridiculous while flinging through the air. Customize your character with a huge variety of <strong>cosmetics</strong>: hats, shirts, accessories, and more. You can even change the color of your clothes and skin, or upload an image of your face onto the ragdoll. Want to see your ragdoll wearing a maid outfit while spinning wildly? Go for it!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE HIDDEN PATHS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not all climbs are straight up. <strong>Secret paths</strong>,<strong> shortcuts</strong>,<strong> </strong>and <strong>hidden areas</strong> are scattered throughout the levels. Discover these routes to unlock exclusive badges and cosmetics.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics-based climbing</strong> - Player is completely ragdoll, but precisely controllable</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Optional Checkpoints</strong> - Enable checkpoints for a more forgiving climbing experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Secret Paths</strong> - Discover hidden areas and unlock exclusive <strong>badges</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character Customization</strong> - Put your face on your ragdoll and change their look</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cosmetics</strong> - Unlock over <strong>100+ cosmetics</strong> for your ragdoll<strong> </strong>just by playing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Level Editor</strong> - Create your very own levels and share them with your friends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leaderboard</strong> - Compete for the fastest times and climb the rankings</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Searching for gold and I found a diamond.&quot; </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>- A Playtester</i></p>","developers":["Studioz"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962540/74976234cabcb16649bdb421256f134b7ce72ad1/header.jpg?t=1774742143","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 12.04+ or SteamOS<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2 GHz Dual Core CPU<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD Graphics 4000 or better<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 12.04+ or SteamOS<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.5 GHz Dual Core CPU<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Geforce GTX 970/Radeon RX470 or better<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> MacOS Big Sur<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2 GHz Dual Core CPU<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD Graphics 4000 or better<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recom